  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tropical Cyclone Yasa Recovery</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The TC Yasa Recovery Program will provide assistance to the Government of Fiji, in its education sector rehabilitation efforts post TC Yasa.  The impact of the project will be improved access to schools.  The outcome will be improved safety and resilience of the education infrastructure.</narrative>
  </description>
